    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain-T is an exploration-driven metroidvania where color is your greatest weapon. The world has been drained of its color, and it has to be restored. As you explore and bring life back to the environment, hostile creatures will stand in your way, determined to stop your mission. Unleash amazing powers, uncover hidden paths, and paint your own destiny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the unknown - Discover the map with every action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astonishing painterly landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and progress at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash abilities that open new possibilites</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain-T is an exploration-driven metroidvania where color is your greatest weapon. The world has been drained of its color, and it has to be restored. As you explore and bring life back to the environment, hostile creatures will stand in your way, determined to stop your mission. Unleash amazing powers, uncover hidden paths, and paint your own destiny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the unknown - Discover the map with every action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astonishing painterly landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and progress at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash abilities that open new possibilites</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Pain-T is an exploration-driven metroidvania where color is your greatest weapon. Restore a world drained of paint, overcome hostile creatures, unlock colorfull powers, reveal hidden paths, and paint your own destiny.",
